  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Sets cave_number to the next cave from the cave table. After intermission 4 it sets cave A and the next level, at most 4."},
    {"at":4,"placement":"side","text":"Reads the cave table at $7e66: two bytes for each cave, cave_number 1-based."},
    {"at":24,"placement":"line","text":"Counts the remaining time down to 0. Each unit adds level plus 1 to the score with a sound. Then goes to the next cave."},
    {"at":40,"placement":"side","text":"Points for each time unit: level plus 1."},
    {"at":48,"placement":"side","text":"Start pitch of the bonus sound."},
    {"at":86,"placement":"line","text":"After a lost life: updates the best score and changes turns. At game over it goes back to the title and fills the score lines."},
    {"at":106,"placement":"line","text":"Ends a cave: the exit gives the time bonus, a death in an intermission goes on, another death costs a life. Updates the status line."},
    {"at":120,"placement":"side","text":"A death in an intermission costs no life."},
    {"at":137,"placement":"side","text":"Player digit in the status line."},
    {"at":145,"placement":"side","text":"Lives digit in the status line."},
    {"at":154,"placement":"side","text":"One life shows MAN, other counts show MEN."}
  ],
